---
source: crates/whetstone/tests/it/settings.rs
expression: session.frame()
---
Buffer {
    area: Rect { x: 0, y: 0, width: 80, height: 24 },
    content: [
        "                                                                                ",
        "  Settings                                                                      ",
        "  Read from ~/.config/whetstone/config.toml. Settings is read-only: edit that   ",
        "  file to change them.                                                          ",
        "                                                                                ",
        "    Provider              OpenRouter (default)                                  ",
        "    Jev model             typesafe/jev-1.14 (default)                           ",
        "    Generator model       anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5 (default)                 ",
        "    OpenRouter key        not set (OPENROUTER_API_KEY)                          ",
        "    Colours               auto (16 detected) (default)                          ",
        "  > Connected code limit  250 KB                                                ",
        "                                                                                ",
        "    Back                                                                        ",
        "                                                                                ",
        "  How much connected code Practice adds to the evidence: what the change        ",
        "  calls, what calls it, and the files it links to or names. From 0 to 400 KB,   ",
        "  and 0 sends none; related tests and configuration still apply. A              ",
        "  repository's .whetstone/config.toml can lower it, never raise it. The         ",
        "  default is 100 KB.                                                            ",
        "  In config.toml: connected_code_limit_kb = 250                                 ",
        "                                                                                ",
        "                                                                                ",
        "  ? keys  : actions  q back                                                     ",
        "                                                                                ",
    ],
    styles: [
        x: 0, y: 0, fg: Reset, bg: Reset, underline: Reset, modifier: NONE,
        x: 2, y: 1, fg: Reset, bg: Reset, underline: Reset, modifier: BOLD,
        x: 10, y: 1, fg: Reset, bg: Reset, underline: Reset, modifier: NONE,
        x: 2, y: 10, fg: Reset, bg: Reset, underline: Reset, modifier: BOLD,
        x: 24, y: 10, fg: Reset, bg: Reset, underline: Reset, modifier: NONE,
    ]
}
